@startuml agentic-culture-organization-boundary
title Agentic Culture / Agentic Organization Boundary ; per ADR-ES-023 section 8

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Culture" as ACult
class "Agentic Organization" as AOrg

ACult --> AOrg : supports
AOrg ..> ACult : is shaped by

note right
  Per ADR-ES-023 section 8:
  An Agentic Organization can exist with limited cultural
  institutionalization. Conversely, an organization may
  develop cultural norms supportive of agentic behavior
  before its operational model becomes materially Agentic.

  Agentic Culture != Agentic Organization.
end note

@enduml
